# robot_chat.pal - real prisc+x poll loop for the drop-in chatbot
# entity's chat window (AI-PUSH-ROADMAP-AND-NUANCES.md, "Track 1's
# Natural Test Surface"). Direct instruction 2026-09-28: "the manager
# should be a pal script instead of C, and we will call event calling
# ops to do the chat" - replaces khtpm_robot_chat_manager.c (retired)
# with a real, thin poll loop matching this house's own established
# shape (014.wsr-pal's pal/main_loop_chtpm.pal: the .pal script is
# JUST the poll/dispatch loop, every real file-parsing/formatting job
# lives in its own small compiled op).
#
# `exec <path>` (a real, generic prisc+x built-in, not a registered
# custom op - see prisc+x.c's own OP_EXEC) resolves a relative path
# against THIS SCRIPT's own directory (g_pal_dir), hence "../ops/+x/...".
# Each op reads PRISC_PROJECT_ROOT (=this window's real entity_dir,
# launch_module()'s own setenv) and KHTPM_HOUSE from its environment -
# no args need passing from this script at all.
li x1, 0

loop:
exec ../ops/+x/rc_check_request.+x
exec ../ops/+x/rc_publish_ui.+x
sleep 300000
j loop
